From ea717a0cd9a10b75530e116c86efce8aceca94eb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 13:21:33 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] fix(desktop): refuse desktopPurpose grant issuance
 without a local origin

A desktopPurpose grant minted through a hub remote-pairing origin was stored
unredeemable: desktopGuiOrigin refuses non-standalone roles, so no local
Desktop origin can ever exist for the record, yet issuance let it land and
relied on the distant redemption check. Require a local pairing origin at
issuance, cover it with a pairing-client regression, fix the stale `ocx gui
pair` help line and the superseded pairing-handoff paragraph.

Generated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)

Co-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
